h exploration of the Bivvy codebase, here's the complete picture of how config loading and error handling works:\\n\\n### 1. **Config File Loading & Parsing**\\n\\n**Location:** `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-7okzbcvu/src/config/loader.rs`\\n\\n**Key Functions:**\\n- `load_merged_config(project_root: &Path)` - Main entry point that discovers and merges all config files\\n- `load_config_file(path: &Path)` - Loads a single file and parses it\\n- `parse_config(content: &str, source_path: &Path)` - YAML parsing to BivvyConfig struct\\n- `load_config_value(path: &Path)` - Loads as raw serde_yaml::Value for merging\\n\\n**Config File Discovery Order (ConfigPaths::discover):**\\n1. Remote base configs (from `extends:`) - handled separately\\n2. User global config (`~/.bivvy/config.yml`) - if exists\\n3. Project config (`.bivvy/config.yml`) - REQUIRED\\n4. Local overrides (`.bivvy/config.local.yml`) - if exists\\n\\n### 2. **Error Handling Infrastructure**\\n\\n**Location:** `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-7okzbcvu/src/error.rs`\\n\\n**Error Types Defined:**\\n- `ConfigNotFound { path }` - File doesn't exist at expected location\\n- `ConfigParseError { path, message }` - YAML parsing failed (wraps serde_yaml error)\\n- `ConfigValidationError { message }` - Invalid structure or values\\n- `UnknownTemplate { name }` - Referenced template doesn't exist\\n- `CircularDependency { cycle }` - Step dependency cycle detected\\n- `Io(std::io::Error)` - File I/O errors\\n- `Other(anyhow::Error)` - Generic wrapped errors\\n\\n**Result Type:** `type Result<T> = std::result::Result<T, BivvyError>;`\\n\\n### 3. **Parsing & Validation Flow**\\n\\n**Location:** `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-7okzbcvu/src/config/validator.rs`\\n\\n**Validation Rules (validate_config):**\\n- Steps must have either `template` or `command`\\n- `depends_on` must reference existing steps\\n- Workflows must reference 